      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With everyone gathered in the office, Nastya tearfully confesses to her father and Kostya that she staged her own kidnapping because her homeless friends desperately needed money. Just as she begs their forgiveness, a squad of police officers called by her mother raids the kitchen.",
      "gap": 0.8
